    "turn_idx": 5,
    "turn_text": "Hi, we are back. It is Just Ask the Question. I am your host, Brian Kerman with me is Congressman Jamie Raskin. And as this is Just Ask the Question, we were talking before we started recording that you've been out and about campaigning. How does it look for Democrats in 2024, Jamie?",
