    "turn_text": "It's propaganda and that's powerful. His opponents are floundering looking for something to run on. It used to be abortion. You know, for years when I was sitting there with the Republicans, abortion was murder. It was a Holocaust. They had to appoint Supreme Court justices who were going to topple Roe v. Wade. They did it. And then they discovered that America is a pro freedom. pro-woman country and pro-reproductive healthcare and suddenly they're losing all over the place, Kansas, Wisconsin, Ohio. People are rejecting their absurd anti-abortion legislation and bans and criminal prohibitions. Now they don't want to talk about that anymore. The cats got their tongue. They won't talk about immigration, but the Democrats and Republicans in the Senate came to an agreement about immigration, and Trump says, no, you've got to reject it. You've got to overthrow that because he needs something",
