    "turn_idx": 15,
    "turn_text": "Well, let's talk about that a little bit, because to me, that's the same type of strategy that Mitch McConnell used in 2016 when you all tried to get someone on the Supreme Court. It was delay, delay, delay, run on an issue and gamble that you're going to get Trump in so you could stack the Supreme Court. I mean, that seems to be what they're doing today.",
