    "turn_text": "Who done it? What is it? This week on Colombo. Well, all right. So let's talk a little bit about how how difficult is it? Look, I've known you for a while. We've had good conversations. You can sit down and, you know, if you agree or disagree with you, I've seen you have civil conversations with people that disagree with you. How hard is it to deal with members of Congress? And I could think of a few names, but I won't name them, Margie Taylor Greene. But others who are just immune to facts, logic, and can't spell a right, but that's another issue. I mean, how difficult is it today, seriously, working in Congress with the other side of the aisle?",
